{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57162","headline":"劝谕诗三首 二 · 傅翕","name":"劝谕诗三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"破戒如船浛，没溺大江海。\n临穷方唤佛，志操不能改。\n命如风中灯，迅灭宁相待。\n身死罪犹存，牵向司鼻门。\n千苦俱时至，万痛切神魂。\n独婴烧煑炙，困剧事难论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"傅翕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}